Third-party data notice: dataset/mlpromise_french.json
======================================================

This repository redistributes a byte-identical copy of the French portion of
ML-Promise, released as Trainset_French.json.

Work: ML-Promise: A Multilingual Dataset for Corporate Promise Verification
Creators: Yohei Seki, Hakusen Shu, Anaïs Lhuissier, Hanwool Lee, Juyeon Kang,
Min-Yuh Day, and Chung-Chi Chen
Published in: EMNLP 2025 (https://aclanthology.org/2025.emnlp-main.1028/)
Source: the paper's Google Drive folder
https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wWwo5DBY2qFj2KSEqjkjinuK5CB5ku5K
Retrieved: 2026-08-25
Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Modifications: none to the stored file. Normalisation is performed at load
time in paper/data_ml.py and paper/labels_ml.py. The exact source file id and
sha256 are recorded in dataset/mlpromise_french_provenance.json.
